  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Health Security (GHS) Project - Enhancing Animal Health Systems and One Health capacities to mitigate zoonotic diseases and antimicrobial resistance (AMR) risks and threats in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to strengthen the capacities of national stakeholders to prevent, detect, and respond to animal and zoonotic disease threats using the One Health Approach in close partnership with public and private sectors actors while improving the country&apos;s Joint External Evaluation (JEE) scores through the implementation of the relevant national policies; National Action Plan for Health Security; National One Health Strategic Plan; National Action Plan for Antimicrobial Resistance; National Biosecurity Policy  Action Plan; National Public Health  Animal Health Workforce Strategies</narrative>
  </description>
